@startuml
!include _astyle.iuml
title 5.1  Master Job / Component Lifecycle (JTS) — Activity
|Logistic|
start
:Register job in JTS
(PS/Job no, part, serial, location);
:Dispatch to workshop (F219);
|Workshop|
:Update status Awaiting-TDI -> TDI
(location Log -> Bay);
:Record tear-down inspection (F116);
if (Outcome?) then (spares needed)
  |Purchasing / OV|
  :Demand spares (F212 / RFQ);
  :Update Awaiting-Spare -> WIP;
elseif (beyond capability) then (yes)
  |Purchasing / OV|
  :Route to Outside Vendor (F135)
  status REC-OV;
else (normal)
  |Workshop|
endif
|Workshop|
:Complete service (F114, F111)
WIP -> Serviceable;
|Finance & Billing|
:Record payment & invoice;
:Set job Completed;
|Logistic|
:Return serviceable item to customer;
stop
@enduml
